验证码识别助手 (captcha-autofill)

This project is a derivative work of "CAPTCHA-automatic-recognition" by anghunk,
https://github.com/anghunk/UserScript/tree/main/CAPTCHA-automatic-recognition,
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Modifications made in this project (2026):

- The source was restructured from a single Vue component into TypeScript modules,
  and the user interface was rewritten in React.
- Provider handling was rewritten around a provider table, and support was added
  for Anthropic Claude, local Ollama, and custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints.
- Model listing was added to the settings panel.
- Detection, auto-recognition and input-filling behaviour was changed as described
  in README.md.
- The script name, author, namespace and icon were changed.

Files carried over from the original project:

- rules.json (unchanged)
- src/prompts.ts (the default prompt text, unchanged)
- src/assets/app.less (original styles, with additions marked at the end of the file)
- LICENSE (unchanged)

